  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon Eco Rough is a sustainable polyester monofilament made from 100% recycled materials. Its surface is dented at 45-degree angles to increase string flexibility and create a softer response while also enhancing ball bite and spin. Designed for players who want durability, control and additional rotation without the overly harsh feel associated with some traditional rough polyester strings, Eco Rough combines modern spin performance with a more sustainable material platform.",

    "zh": "Luxilon Eco Rough 是一款采用 100% 再生材料制造的环保型聚酯单丝球线。其表面以 45 度角形成凹纹结构，可提升球线弯曲能力，使击球反馈比传统粗糙型聚酯更加柔和，同时增强咬球能力和旋转表现。它适合希望兼顾耐久、控制、强旋转以及更舒适击球感的中高级球员，同时也是 Luxilon 环保系列中的主要旋转型产品。"
  },

